  "behavior": "A field counts for a `Form` while the browser lists an input of its control in the elements of the `<form>` (`element.form`). A control that a `Teleport` moves out of the `<form>` counts when it has the `form` attribute with the `id` of the form, as in HTML. A group with no mounted input does not count. So the fields that the form validates and the values that the form submits (`FormData`) are the same set. Base UI counts each field below the `Form` in the React tree, also a control in a portal and a group with no input.",
